{{INTERNAL_LINKING_STRATEGY}}
{{INTERNAL_LINKING_STANDARD}}



  Start directly with the ## section heading. Prohibit outputting meta-information such as the main article title, author, date, or abstract.
  Use standard markdown: ## for sections, ### for subsections (if needed), no # for paragraphs.
  Leave 1 blank line between sections and 1 blank line between paragraphs.
  Restrict the output content strictly to the pure article body, without any conversational, explanatory, or introductory text.
  Word count must reach 85-100% of the length range.
  All content must be highly correlated with the category.
  Fully deliver on the value promise of the title and the benefits of the value.




  Confirm before outputting:
  ✓ Starts with ## heading, no preceding content
  ✓ Output content strictly limited to the pure article body, no conversational or explanatory text
  ✓ Title promise is delivered in the first paragraph
  ✓ Each section has independent value; each paragraph has substantive information
  ✓ Word count target met, keywords naturally integrated
  ✓ Free of empty expressions and cliches
